From 0f04553c30d86a3fbea47191926a437314d55949 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kedar Bala <kedar@ornatesolar.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 08:15:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20make=20all=20device=20counts=20dynamic?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20Groups=201,=202,=203?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Group 1 — Equipment view fully dynamic
- types/index.ts: extract WaterChillerInfo; CabinetDetail.waterChiller -> waterChillers[]
- equipment.mock.ts: water chiller, fire protection, PCS/BMS sub-device lists derived from mockHierarchy(); remove .slice(0,2) caps; meter count from grid count
- EssCabinetView.tsx: loop over waterChillers[]; adaptive 0/1/N chiller layout; Cell tab bar chart implemented
- SubDeviceView.tsx: availableTabs computed from non-empty fetch results; UPS tab removed
- pcs.ts adapter: fetchCabinetDetailReal returns waterChillers: []

Group 2 — Strategy service layer + dynamic data analysis points
- lib/api/mock/strategy.mock.ts: new — mockAntiBackflowData, threshold scales with installedKw
- lib/api/services/strategy.service.ts: new — IS_MOCK/apiFetch routing
- hooks/useStrategy.ts: new — useAntiBackflow(stationId, date, meterId?)
- StrategyManagement.tsx: remove inline mock fn; wire useAntiBackflow + useMeterData
- dataAnalysis.mock.ts: replace static MOCK_POINTS with mockPointList(stationId) generating per-cabinet points from mockHierarchy()

Group 3 — Curve report power scaling dynamic
- curveReport.mock.ts: replace all hardcoded stationId chains with mockStationSummary(stationId).installedKw/.capacityKwh; mockPcsCurve scales to per-cabinet power
- curveReport.service.ts + useCurveReport.ts + SingleCabinetPcs.tsx: thread stationId through fetchPcsCurve
